<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text">Kalpataru Advay by Kalpataru in Borivali West, Mumbai is a Under Construction Apartment development with 2 BHK, 3 BHK, 4 BHK Flats configurations. Unit sizes range from 780 Sq.Ft. to 1835 Sq.Ft. across a total area of 5.89 Acres. Prices begin at ₹ 3.34 Cr, with possession expected by Jun 2030.</div>
