        <aside class="project-sidebar">
          
          
          <section class="why-consider" aria-labelledby="why-consider-heading">
            <h2 class="why-consider-heading" id="why-consider-heading">Why you should consider Kalpataru Advay?</h2>
            
              <div class="why-consider-list" id="why-consider-list">
              <ul><li>Strategically located at Borivali West, near New Link Road and Western Express Highway</li><li>Offering 2BHK, 3BHK, and 4BHK apartments with spacious living areas</li><li>Elevate your lifestyle with top-notch amenities including gymnasium and power backup</li><li>Opt for a masterpiece with oil-bound distemper walls and premium specifications</li><li>Experience a serene living with a range of unit options available</li><li>Invest in a secure and convenient residential property with modern amenities</li><li>Offers gymnasium, power backup, 24x7 security, massage room, and central green park for a high-end lifestyle</li><li>Constructed by Kalpataru, renowned for quality construction and timely completion</li><li>RERA Registered project, it guarantees transparency and compliance with regulatory norms</li><li>Situated near schools, hospitals, shopping malls, and entertainment areas</li><li>46% open area in the project, ensuring a peaceful living environment</li></ul>
              </div>
            
            <button type="button" class="view-more" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="why-consider-modal" aria-label="View more"> View More </button>
          </section>
          
          
