 <section class="white-box about-project" id="about-project" aria-labelledby="about-project-heading">
          <span class="section-label">Overview</span>
          <h2 class="section-title" id="about-project-heading">About Kalpataru Advay, Borivali West by Kalpataru</h2>
          
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>Nestled in the bustling suburb of Borivali West, Kalpataru Advay presents more than a home; it presents a destination that signifies tradition, aspirations, and long-term value.<br></p><p>Aimed at the families in search of something different, the project offers expansive 2, 3, and 4 BHK homes of 780 to 1,800 sq. ft. in size, stressing open spaces, space for privacy, and superior tastes, spread over 5.89 acres of landscape comprised of 650 private homes.</p><p>With low-density planning enabling only up to six residences per level, Advay integrates high-rise living with intelligent infrastructure and over 50 varied amenities, designed to suit every life phase.</p><p><strong>RERA Number: P51800077381</strong></p><strong>A Life Edited for Comfort, Wellness, and Style </strong><ul><li><strong>Podium &amp; Eco-Deck:</strong> Relax in indoor games, a music lounge, meeting spaces, children activity spaces, and warm leisure pools, all linked together in a lively, multi-level environment.</li><li><strong>Clubhouse &amp; Wellness:</strong> State-of-the-art gym, spa, sports courts for badminton and squash, AV lounge, and chic areas for celebrations.</li><li><strong>Landscape Outdoors:</strong> Tranquil amphitheatre lawns, picnic nooks, yoga sites, special pet park, and quiet, tree-lined areas for private reflection.</li><li><strong>Family &amp; Active Spaces:</strong> Pickleball courts, cricket nets, jogging tracks, wheelchair-accessible seating, and fun-filled sandpits for kids.</li><li><strong>Green Living:</strong> Miyawaki forest cultivated with great care, Rainwater harvesting systems, Sewage Treatment Plants, organic handling of wastes, and drip irrigation systems.</li><li><strong>Smart Safety:</strong> Continuous water supply, intercom systems, around-the-clock CCTV coverage, fire protection, modern lifts, and reliable backup power. Premium Interiors: Elegant Italian marble, high-end fixtures, discreet cabling, and classic, durable finishes.</li></ul><p>Here, everything is designed for wellness, where the luxury, practical features, and environmental practices converge seamlessly.</p><strong>A Location That Works for You, Today and Tomorrow</strong><ul><li>Located just 600m from Metro Line 2A and 0.5 km from New Link Road, </li><li>Kalpataru Advay ensures seamless access to Western Express Highway, CSMIA Airport (~16.6 km), and major IT hubs like Techno IT Park and Kowork.</li><li>Top schools, hospitals, retail, and recreational spots lie minutes away.<br></li></ul><p>Making this a rare micro-market with both urban energy and residential calm.</p><strong>Future-Forward Connectivity and Investment Potential</strong><ul><li>With upcoming metro lines (7, 7A, 2B, 9), Borivali–Thane Twin Tunnel, and Coastal Road extensions, Borivali is becoming a connectivity powerhouse.</li><li>Borivali West has shown property appreciation of 21.3% in 5 years and 37.4% over 10 years, backed by stable rental yields and growing investor demand.</li></ul><p>Developed by the Kalpataru Group, one of India’s most respected builders with over 113 completed projects, numerous global awards, and a legacy dating back to 1969, this address reflects precision, trust, and progressive urban living.<br>Kalpataru Advay isn’t just an address; it’s a rare blend of legacy, growth, and lifestyle excellence. Own a future that appreciates in every way.<br></p></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

      </section>



      
