            <div id="master-plan-details-panel-1" class="master-plan-details master-plan-detail-panel active">
              <h3 class="master-plan-title">Master Plan 1</h3>
              
                
<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text master-plan-info"><div class="item"><strong>Overview about Kalpataru Advay</strong><ul><li>Kalpataru Advay is a residential development designed for modern living, offering a blend of natural surroundings and diverse amenities. The project provides a comfortable home environment with a focus on outdoor spaces and community interaction.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Land Use and Density</strong><ul><li>Around 40%-48% of the plot is green, anchored by the BUTTERFLY & AROMATIC GARDENS, a serene FOREST TRAIL, and an ORCHARD, providing residents with lush natural settings.</li><li>The open area covers 48%-55% of the plot, and SEATING SPOTS, a PICKLEBALL COURT, and an inviting ENTRY FEATURE fill the non-green stretches, giving residents places to gather and engage in activities outside their homes.</li><li>Only 15%-20% of the plot has been built on, so homes here get ample breathing space and natural light, with views of open areas rather than other buildings.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Connectivity Access</strong><ul><li>The project is close to New Link Road and Western Express Highway, so getting around the city is convenient for residents.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Amenities Lifestyle</strong><ul><li>The presence of a CLUBHOUSE provides a central hub for community activities and social gatherings.</li><li>An OUTDOOR FITNESS ZONE, this amenity, and CRICKET PITCH mean residents can pursue various sports and fitness routines within the community.</li><li>A KIDS PLAY AREA, PET PARK, and LAWN WITH AMPHITHEATER offer dedicated spaces for children, pets, and community gatherings.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Tower Placement Orientation</strong><ul><li>Tower A stands on the western side of the property.</li><li>Tower B is positioned along the southern boundary.</li><li>Tower C is located on the eastern part of the site.</li><li>The three towers create a central open space.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Amenity Access</strong><ul><li>Residents of Tower A have quick access to this amenity.</li><li>Tower B residents can easily reach the HAMMOCK GROVE.</li><li>Tower C is conveniently near the TEMPLE.</li><li>The central green zone, including the YOGA LAWN, is within a short walk for all residents.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Noise Privacy Road Facing</strong><ul><li>Residential blocks are set back from the northern road.</li><li>Parking areas provide a buffer against street noise.</li><li>The central green spaces offer a quiet environment.</li><li>Inward-facing homes overlook landscaped areas, enhancing privacy.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Corridor Analysis</strong><ul><li>The U-shaped tower arrangement allows open views into the central area.</li><li>Gaps between tower wings promote light and air circulation.</li><li>The central driveway provides separation for residential blocks.</li><li>This design ensures good natural light for many homes.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Internal Circulation Pedestrian</strong><ul><li>A main driveway serves as the primary route for cars.</li><li>Dedicated drop-off points exist for TOWER A, TOWER B, and TOWER C.</li><li>Pedestrian paths are integrated alongside the main driveway.</li><li>Residents can walk through the extensive green areas.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Child Senior Friendly Zones</strong><ul><li>Central green spaces offer safe areas for children.</li><li>This amenity are distributed throughout landscaped zones for older residents.</li><li>This amenity provides a quiet place for contemplation.</li><li>This amenity offers a relaxed setting for all ages.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Green Cover Landscape</strong><ul><li>A large central green expanse dominates the interior.</li><li>Greenery extends along the northern and southern boundaries.</li><li>The PALM GROVE adds a distinct natural element.</li><li>This amenity provides an open, planted area.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Traffic Flow Access Planning</strong><ul><li>A single main access point manages cars entering and leaving.</li><li>The central driveway guides cars to tower drop-off points.</li><li>Parking is available both above ground and in basement areas.</li><li>The layout ensures smooth movement of cars within the complex.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Overall Livability Assessment</strong><ul><li>This area offers a living environment where natural elements integrate with residential blocks.</li><li>The property's design supports resident well-being and social interaction.</li><li>Diverse activities are available for all age groups across the site.</li><li>The thoughtful arrangement of towers and amenities creates a cohesive environment.</li></ul></div><div class="item"><strong>Final Summary</strong><p>Living at this area means enjoying a lifestyle deeply connected to nature and community, with abundant green spaces and diverse outdoor activities right at your doorstep. Families and wellness-seekers will find dedicated zones for children, pets, and personal well-being, fostering a balanced daily routine. This project stands out for its commitment to extensive green coverage and a wide array of recreational amenities, offering a refreshing escape within the city.</p></div></div>
  <div class="read-more-button-box">
    <button type="button" class="read-more-button global-read-more-btn" aria-expanded="false" id="master-plan-details-readmore-1">Read More</button>
  </div>
</div>

              
            
          </div>
          
       
        
