<div class="description-content-box">
  <div class="desc-text"><p>A top dog on the list of the best real estate developers in India, Kalpataru Group has been creating beautifully crafted homes and well planned locations in India since 1969.
One of the top real estate firms in India was founded in 1969 and is called Kalpataru Limited. Kalpataru, a recipient of numerous international honours for quality and design, has built iconic structures that have advanced real estate development standards for nearly 50 years. From pioneering the idea of 1.5 bedroom residences to developing Asia's first and the sixth Platinum LEED certified commercial building to being among the first to implement eco-friendly construction practices, Kalpataru's buildings are today ever-expanding dynamic lifespaces for thousands of content families. In the 1970s, Kalpataru built Mumbai's tallest residential skyscraper, a record that remained for the next quarter of a century.
Kalpataru Limited conducts business in real estate development. The business creates integrated townships, retail locations, and commercial and residential properties in addition to offering logistical, civil infrastructure, and power distribution and transmission services. India is the primary market for Kalpataru.
The development and construction of upscale residential towers, townships, gated communities, and commercial buildings have been Kalpataru Limited's specialty for more than 50 years. Their extensive legacy is attested to by their more than 100 awards and accolades.
Their mission is as follows:-
“To be a brand that is admired as an industry leader for its thoughtfully designed, high quality, innovative life-spaces, is recognised for its customer and employee practises, and is acknowledged for fostering long term relationships with stakeholders.”</p></div>
