  <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization","name":"Square Yards","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","contentUrl":"https://www.squareyards.com/assets/images/squareyards-logo-new.png","caption":"Square Yards"},"image":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#logo"},"address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"M3M Urbana Business Park, 1st Floor, Tower A, Sector 67","addressLocality":"Gurgaon","addressRegion":"Haryana","postalCode":"122102","addressCountry":"IN"},"contactPoint":[{"@type":"ContactPoint","email":"connect@squareyards.com","availableLanguage":"en"}],"sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/SquareYards","https://www.linkedin.com/company/square-yards","https://www.youtube.com/@Square_Yards","https://www.instagram.com/square_yards/"]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#website","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/","name":"Square Yards","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization"},"inLanguage":"en-IN"},{"@type":"Organization","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/kalpataru-projects/532/builder#organization","name":"Kalpataru","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/kalpataru-projects/532/builder","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kalpataru-532-5000.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/kalpataru-532-5000.jpg","caption":"Kalpataru developer logo"},"description":"A top dog on the list of the best real estate developers in India, Kalpataru Group has been creating beautifully crafted homes and well planned locations in India since 1969.\r\nOne of the top real estate firms in India was founded in 1969 and is called Kalpataru Limited. Kalpataru, a recipient of numerous international honours for quality and design, has built iconic structures that have advanced real estate development standards for nearly 50 years. From pioneering the idea of 1.5 bedroom residences to developing Asia's first and the sixth Platinum LEED certified commercial building to being among the first to implement eco-friendly construction practices, Kalpataru's buildings are today ever-expanding dynamic lifespaces for thousands of content families. In the 1970s, Kalpataru built Mumbai's tallest residential skyscraper, a record that remained for the next quarter of a century.\r\nKalpataru Limited conducts business in real estate development. The business creates integrated townships, retail locations, and commercial and residential properties in addition to offering logistical, civil infrastructure, and power distribution and transmission services. India is the primary market for Kalpataru.\r\nThe development and construction of upscale residential towers, townships, gated communities, and commercial buildings have been Kalpataru Limited's specialty for more than 50 years. Their extensive legacy is attested to by their more than 100 awards and accolades.\r\nTheir mission is as follows:-\r\n“To be a brand that is admired as an industry leader for its thoughtfully designed, high quality, innovative life-spaces, is recognised for its customer and employee practises, and is acknowledged for fostering long term relationships with stakeholders.” As listed on Square Yards, Kalpataru has 185 total projects, of which 145 are delivered."},{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#primaryimage","url":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-advay-project-project-large-image1-9864.jpg","contentUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-advay-project-project-large-image1-9864.jpg","caption":"Cover image of Kalpataru Advay, Borivali West, Mumbai"},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.squareyards.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"New Projects in Mumbai","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/new-projects-in-mumbai"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Projects in Borivali West","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/projects-in-borivali-west-mumbai"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Kalpataru Advay","item":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project"}]},{"@type":"RealEstateListing","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#webpage","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project","name":"Kalpataru Advay, Borivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹3.34 Cr Onwards | 2, 3, 4 BHK Flats Available","description":"Kalpataru Advay Borivali West, Mumbai - Under Construction, 2, 3 & 4 BHK [780-1835 sqft], ₹3.34 Cr-₹7.99 Cr. Kalpataru Advay Mumbai offers 650 Units on 5.89 Acres. Explore Kalpataru Advay Floor Plans, Amenities, RERA Details & Location. Our USPs include: ✓ Detailed Floor Plans & Master Plan, ✓ Transparent Prices and Market Trends, ✓ Complete RERA Details, ✓ Trusted Developer Track Record, ✓ Compare Similar Projects, ✓ Prime Location & Connectivity Info. Hurry up! Book your site visit on Square Yards.","inLanguage":"en-IN","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#website"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#breadcrumb"},"mainEntity":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#project"},"relatedLink":"https://www.squareyards.com/cma/compare-kalpataru-advay-with-similar-nearby-projects","primaryImageOfPage":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#primaryimage"},"mentions":[{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/kalpataru-projects/532/builder#organization"},{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/borivali-west-in-mumbai-overview-941#place"},{"@type":"ApartmentComplex","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#project","name":"Kalpataru Advay","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Mumbai Western Suburbs","addressLocality":"Mumbai","addressRegion":"","addressCountry":"IN"},"additionalProperty":[{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Average Asking Price","value":38150,"unitText":"INR per Sq. Ft."}]},{"@type":"ApartmentComplex","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/jpv-pratap-palace/27097/project#project","name":"JPV Pratap Palace","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/jpv-pratap-palace/27097/project","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Mumbai Western Suburbs","addressLocality":"Mumbai","addressRegion":"","addressCountry":"IN"},"additionalProperty":[{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Average Asking Price","value":40300,"unitText":"INR per Sq. Ft."}]},{"@type":"ApartmentComplex","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-vienta/30226/project#project","name":"Kalpataru Vienta","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-vienta/30226/project","address":{"@type":"PostalAddress","streetAddress":"Mumbai Western Suburbs","addressLocality":"Mumbai","addressRegion":"","addressCountry":"IN"},"additionalProperty":[{"@type":"PropertyValue","name":"Average Asking Price","value":42350,"unitText":"INR per Sq. Ft."}]}],"hasPart":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#