y?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kalpataru Advay is currently a new launch, indicating that it is in the initial stages of development."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you provide details about the types of apartments available in Kalpataru Advay?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kalpataru Advay offers a range of luxurious apartments including 2 BHK, 3 BHK (with two size options), and 4 BHK configurations."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is the developer behind Kalpataru Advay?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The developer of Kalpataru Advay is Kalpataru, which has successfully completed a total of 180 projects."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What amenities can residents expect at Kalpataru Advay?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Residents of Kalpataru Advay can enjoy amenities such as a gymnasium, power backup, 24 x 7 security, a massage room, and a central green park."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How accessible is Kalpataru Advay to public transport and major roads?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kalpataru Advay boasts unbeatable connectivity to major roads, including New Link Road and the Western Express Highway, ensuring easy access to public transport."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the expected possession date for units in Kalpataru Advay?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The expected possession date for units in Kalpataru Advay has not been specified yet, as it is currently a new launch."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is the project RERA registered?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kalpataru Advay is RERA registered, with transparency and compliance with regulations."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the total plot area of the project?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kalpataru Advay has an area of 5.89 acres, and there is ample area for facilities and open space."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the possession date of Kalpataru Advay?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The project Kalpataru Advay will be ready for possession by June 2030."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is there enough open space in the project?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, the project is offering 46% open space, making sure that it will be a peaceful living space."}}]},{"@type":"VideoObject","@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#video-1","name":"Kalpataru Advay, Borivali West, Mumbai | Project Video","description":"Project video of Kalpataru Advay, a 2, 3, 4 BHK BHK residential development by Kalpataru in Borivali West, Mumbai, showing the towers, amenities and layout.","thumbnailUrl":"https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-advay-project-project-large-image1-9864.jpg","uploadDate":"2026-08-03T00:00:00+05:30","contentUrl":"https://img.squareyards.com/rcheck/projectvideos/307604-builder-kalpataru-advay.mp4","url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project","publisher":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/#organization"},"about":{"@id":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kalpataru-advay/307604/project#project"}}]}</script>

